{"overview":"ناپدید شدن مرموز یک کشتی ماهیگیری اسکاتلندی و مرگ یک نفر در زیردریایی HMS Vigil، پلیس را با نیروی دریایی و سرویس‌های امنیتی بریتانیا درگیر می‌کند. افسر اطلاعات ایمی سیلوا و افسر اطلاعات کیرستن لانگاکر، تحقیقاتی را در خشکی و دریا در مورد توطئه‌ای که به قلب امنیت ملی بریتانیا ضربه می‌زند، رهبری می‌کنند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"The mysterious disappearance of a Scottish fishing trawler and a death on-board the submarine HMS Vigil bring the police into conflict with the Navy and British security services. DCI Amy Silva and DS Kirsten Longacre lead an investigation on land and at sea into a conspiracy that goes to the very heart of Britain’s national security.","tagline_en":"The deeper you go, the darker it gets.","runtime":58,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":6,"y":2021,"poster":"/ddMnBwhbtKGKhKwgIE1Duv6iY3a.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":6,"y":2023,"poster":"/8L7XYtKs0wk6XG9kWodHRnt4WI6.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":6,"y":2026,"poster":"/mmNjcRq47U1UVPnOuD2EYxx6Dno.jpg"},{"n":4,"name":"فصل 4","ep":0,"y":null,"poster":""},{"n":5,"name":"فصل 5","ep":0,"y":null,"poster":""}],"episodes":18,"crew":["Tom Edge"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["GB"],"cast":[{"name":"Suranne Jones","role":"Amy Silva","photo":"/mwoX6TauWmPOgmRyvgMwp7nAXVB.jpg"},{"name":"رز لزلی","role":"Kirsten Longacre","photo":"/4XD7YmJ0W2P8iIOCy0sdtM2ABr7.jpg","en":"Rose Leslie"},{"name":"Dominic Mafham","role":"Sir Ian Downing","photo":"/9IgOMf8JOu3m3tz7yHbXCn5nMCJ.jpg"},{"name":"Steven Miller","role":"Mark Cunningham","photo":"/11gMgxiilUqxdD5ie4fvjLJJKK8.jpg"}],"trailer":"Ja74lUBNIQ8","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/126167-vigil/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Peacock Premium","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/a1UIdq5BrkcAxnxcUhFsNbXnxeu.png"},{"n":"Peacock Premium Plus","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/yrEwyMzEKdqAoGhaWUARtIxByol.png"}]},"GB":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/126167-vigil/watch?locale=GB","p":[{"n":"Sky Go","kind":"flatrate","logo